le.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"CK9TIa7vdehO","name":"Furious Aura","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This model and its unit get Furious.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"zGew9XZT2rUm","name":"Relentless Aura","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This model and its unit get Relentless.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"Tdyu4Tn-rFN6","name":"Scout Aura","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This model and its unit get Scout.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"97aE8SunQBTq","name":"Purge","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"When attacking units that are Shaken or Fatigued, this weapon gets AP(+2).","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":2},{"id":"MK_o4HpuB-pL","name":"Dangerous Terrain Debuff","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Once per activation, before attacking, pick one enemy unit within 18\" in line of sight, which counts as being in Dangerous terrain once (next time the effect would apply).","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"Ww4ehASqnek0","name":"Scourge","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"For each unmodified result of 1 to block hits, enemies count as having taken 2 extra wounds when checking who won melee, or if shooting wounds would trigger Morale Tests.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":2},{"id":"Hdm9ry6kJvzb","name":"Crossing Strike","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Once per activation, when this model moves through enemy units, pick one of them and attack it with this weapon as if it was shooting. This weapon may only be used in this way.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":2},{"id":"QXyt-zV_bjpg","name":"Unstoppable","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This weapon ignores Regeneration, and ignores all negative modifiers which are not from this model's special rules.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":2},{"id":"UQ7FtljwqNvy","name":"Versatile Defense Aura","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This model and its unit get Versatile Defense.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"efmjJPTe0Yzd","name":"Anti-Cover","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This weapon ignores Cover.","hasRating":false,"coreType":5,"targetType":2},{"id":"dNOZEOSJ-DyX","name":"Enhanced Warbound Aura","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This model and its unit get Enhanced Warbound.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"zVconc6Qb-g9","name":"Heavy Impact","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Counts as having Impact(X) with hits that have AP(1).","hasRating":true,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"WHJ8A7LzHUR6","name":"Violent","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"When this model shoots/charges enemies over 9\"/6\" away, unmodified results of 1 to block hits from weapons deal 1 extra wound.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"5NeMSSj7-Pp5","name":"Enhanced Violent","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"If this model has Violent, enemies always take wounds on unmodified results of 1 to block from Violent (instead of only when shooting/charging enemies over 9\"/6\" away).","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"CQes0mDvF4bV","name":"AP","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"AP","hasRating":true,"coreType":1,"targetType":2},{"id":"j93FkLXMCk8v","name":"Steadfast","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"If a unit where most models have this rule is Shaken at the beginning of the round, roll one die. On a 4+, it stops being Shaken.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"h-Cj1XrX00JE","name":"Spell Resistance","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"When a unit where most models have this rule takes wounds, roll one die for each. If the wound was from a spell, then it is ignored on a 2+. If the wound was not from a spell, then it is ignored on a 6+ instead.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"s6MgSfmgylXU","name":"Defense","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This model gets +X to Defense rolls.","hasRating":true,"coreType":5,"targetType":1},{"id":"a0YtInGiUDd6","name":"Tough","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This model must take X wounds before being killed. If a model with Tough joins a unit without it, then it is removed last when the unit takes wounds. You must continue to put wounds on the Tough model with most wounds in the unit until it is killed, before starting to put them on the next Tough model (Heroes must be assigned wounds last, even if already wounded).","hasRating":true,"coreType":1,"targetType":1},{"id":"JoOCVPx1xT1G","name":"Furious","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"When charging, unmodified result of 6 to hit deal 1 extra hit (only the original hit counts as a 6 for special rules).","hasRating":false,"coreType":1,"targetType":1},{"id":"H9E9PIWpGRdw","name":"Relentless","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"When this model shoots at enemies over 9” away, unmodified result of 6 to hit deal 1 extra hit (only the original hit counts as a 6 for special rules).","hasRating":false,"coreType":1,"targetType":1},{"id":"FAMbscK5vhSu","name":"Scout","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"May be set aside before deployment. After all other units are deployed, may be deployed anywhere fully within 9” of their deployment zone, over 9” away from non-Scout enemy units. Players alternate in placing Scout units, starting with the player that activates next.","hasRating":false,"coreType":1,"targetType":1},{"id":"8KujvrTG8k9p","name":"Regeneration","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"When a unit where most models have this rule takes wounds, roll one die for each. On a 5+ it is ignored.","hasRating":false,"coreType":1,"targetType":1},{"id":"eXtrmDIR9dEp","name":"Versatile Defense","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"When a unit where most models have this rule is shot/charged from over 9\"/6\" away, pick one effect: the unit either gets +1 to Defense rolls, or enemy units get -1 to hit rolls against it. Note that you may pick a different effect each time the unit is attacked.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"62-mYKVM9MLd","name":"Impact","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"When charging, before either unit attacks, roll X dice, unless this unit is Fatigued. For each 2+ the target takes 1 hit.","hasRating":true,"coreType":1,"targetType":1},{"id":"cU3RtuBXHyq4","name":"Blast","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"If the target is hit all models within 4“ of it are also hit by this weapon.","hasRating":false,"coreType":1,"targetType":2}],"forceOrgErrors":[]}